<title>NEW ZEALAND: TENNIS-BELLSOUTH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-BELLSOUTH OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from second round of</p>
<p>BellSouth Open tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Christian Ruud (Norway) 6-0 7-5</p>
<p>1-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Jeff Tarango (U.S.) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Jan-Michael Gambill (U.S.) beat Chris Woodruff (U.S.) 5-7 6-2</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Marcos Ondruska (South Africa) beat Karol Kucera (Slovakia) 2-6</p>
<p>6-2 6-3.</p>
</text>
